ii. Starting Wireshark
iii. Viewing Captured Traffic
iv. Analysis and Statistics & Filters.

Steps:
- Open Wireshark
- Select network interface (WiFi/Ethernet)
- Click Start Capture
- Generate traffic (open browser/ping)
- Stop capture
- Use filters like:
  ip.addr == 192.168.1.1
  tcp
- Analyze packets in packet details pane
